---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="License | BlueFx Markets" description="Sample licence profile for the BlueFx Markets demonstration website in Windhoek." page="license">
<main id="content">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="crumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Company / License</p>
        <h1>Licence profile</h1>
        <p class="lede">This is sample content for the BlueFx Markets demonstration website. It is not a real licence, and it is not permission to take deposits in Namibia.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="licence">
          <div><span>Entity</span><strong>BlueFx Markets (demonstration)</strong></div>
          <div><span>Sample reference</span><strong>BFX-DEMO-NA-2026</strong></div>
          <div><span>Sample registration</span><strong>CC/2024/08421</strong></div>
          <div><span>Status</span><strong>Illustration only — not issued by a regulator</strong></div>
          <div><span>Home office</span><strong>Windhoek, Namibia</strong></div>
          <div><span>Account currency</span><strong>NAD</strong></div>
          <div><span>Activities described</span><strong>FX, CFDs, metals, indices, energy, synthetic indices</strong></div>
          <div><span>Payments partner on the demo</span><strong>DPO Pay by Network</strong></div>
          <div><span>Complaints email</span><strong>support@bluefxmarkets.com</strong></div>
          <div><span>Client money, as described</span><strong>Sample wording only: NAD balances held apart from the firm’s own money</strong></div>
        </div>
        <div class="two" style="margin-top:22px">
          <article class="panel">
            <h3>What a live licence page would be for</h3>
            <p>A real Namibian financial firm would show the regulator, the licence class and the activities it is allowed to carry on. This page uses the same layout so the demo looks complete: a reference, a status, a currency and a complaints path.</p>
            <p>The reference BFX-DEMO-NA-2026 is made up for the design. Do not send money because of it. Do not treat the Windhoek address as a place that can accept a deposit today.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="panel">
            <h3>If you need a person</h3>
            <p>The demonstration inbox is support@bluefxmarkets.com. The sample phone is +264 61 400 2800, weekdays 08:00–17:00 CAT.</p>
            <p>Read the legal summaries next to this profile. They are written in the same spirit: complete enough to design the site, and labelled as samples.</p>
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/legal">Legal documents</a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>
